Brief Profile: Mr. Vinod Kumar Aggarwal is an industry veteran with an experience of 45 years, out of which 43 years has been with Eicher Group. In his long and successful career with Eicher, spanning over four decades, Mr. Vinod Kumar Aggarwal has held several management positions including being the Chief Financial Officer of the Eicher Group from 2005-2009 and President of Eicher Trucks and Buses. After leading VE Commercial Vehicles Limited (“VECV”) (Company’s joint venture with AB Volvo) for around 16 years, initially as CEO and thereafter as CEO and Managing Director, Mr. Vinod Kumar Aggarwal was appointed as the Non Executive Chairman of VECV (as a nominee of Eicher Motors Limited) with effect from April 1, 2026.
